meta {
  name: Get Report Detail By ID
  type: http
  seq: 3
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/report/detail/item/:id
  body: none
  auth: bearer
}

params:path {
  id: e1288783-a5d4-1c4c-2cd6-0e92f7cc3bf9
}

auth:bearer {
  token: {{token}}
}

docs {
  # Get report detail by id

  This request is used to get report detail by id and all items found in the report. This request interacts with the MySQL database, and has protected routes.

  ## Path Parameters

  | Name | Type   | Required | Description | Example                               |
  |------|--------|----------|--------------|------------------------------------------|
  | id   | string | yes      | Report ID   | e1288783-a5d4-1c4c-2cd6-0e92f7cc3bf9   |

  ## Responses

  **200 — Report fetched**
```json
  {
    "status": "success",
    "message": "report fetched",
    "data": {
      "id": "6f59235e-c398-8a83-2f95-3f1fbe95ca6e",
      "report_title": "Report A",
      "report_desc": "This is a report description",
      "report_category": "Shopping Cart",
      "report_image": "https://...",
      "is_reminder": 0,
      "reminder_at": null,
      "total_item": 1,
      "created_at": "2024-09-20 22:53:47"
    },
    "data_item": [
      {
        "id": "6f59235e-c398-8a83-2f95-3f1fbe95ca6e",
        "item_name": "Nivea Extra White Repair & Protect",
        "item_desc": "This is a report description",
        "item_qty": 1,
        "item_price": 20000,
        "created_at": "2024-09-20 22:53:47"
      }
    ]
  }
```

  **401 — protected route need to include sign in token as authorization bearer**
```json
  {
    "status": "failed",
    "message": "you need to include the authorization token from login"
  }
```

  **404 — report failed to fetched**
```json
  {
    "status": "failed",
    "message": "report not found"
  }
```

  **500 — Internal Server Error**
```json
  {
    "status": "error",
    "message": "something wrong. please contact admin"
  }
```
}